BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Inside Sound
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260523T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260523T210000
UID:c38ee10a9fa08519c1634c32@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Join this listening session\, designed to encourage the develo
 pment of positive emotion and states of meditative absorption. Through man
 tra chanting\, singing bowls and wind gong\, Aryavandana and Dayabhadra wi
 ll offer sound as a devotional practice\, rooted in their shared love of t
 he Dharma.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/inside-sound-2026-05-23
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Transforming Self & World
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260524T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260524T123000
UID:612c8f57418c8f78c448ed53@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:On this occasion we welcome special guest and friend of the LB
 C\, Marc Robinson. Marc has spent his career working as a nurse\, midwife\
 , and humanitarian in the UK\, and in conflicts\, disease outbreaks\, and 
 natural disasters around the world.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/transforming-self-world-
 may-marc-robinson
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
