DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260524T170000
UID:20171d4c1e9baf9697a3427b@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:As a society\, we rarely discuss death\, even though death is 
 the only inevitable thing in life. Death cafes offer an opportunity to sha
 re with others our experiences\, ideas and feelings about death and dying.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/death-cafe-may-2026
